                    <StackPanel Visibility="{variable:Clip2:Collapsed}">
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="1. 毒树脂" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="“对以上的注释：这些词很好，但我找不到它们的用途[G]。点赞、评论并订阅！我们下次再见，拜拜！”（Comment on ^: These are nice, but I can&apos;t find a use for them [G]. Leave a like, leave a comment, and subscribe!, and see you in the next one, bye!）" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="2. 三叉戟" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="三叉戟的音效是音效师Samuel Åberg用金属尺录制的。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="3. 树苗" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="树苗生长的过程本质上是放置了地物，因此如果使用命令将树苗放置在不具有#dirt标签的方块（如圆石）上，则树苗生长时也会将其替换成泥土或灰化土（若为大型云杉）。" />
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
